==English==
{{wikipedia}}
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|bohémien||person from [[Bohemia]], [[Romani]]|lang=fr}}, from {{term|Bohême||[[Bohemia]]|lang=fr}}. Regarding the sense evolution, compare {{term|gypsy|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[unconventional]] or [[nonconformist]] [[artist]] or [[writer]].

